[Music]  on the 1st of april this video filmed by  a ukrainian soldier emerged it appears  to show dead bodies in the street of  butcher a town north of kiev  president zielenski accused russia of  committing war crimes in the town  but the kremlin has claimed the scenes  in the town were staged and cynical  ukrainian propaganda  by analyzing satellite imagery taken on  the 19th of march it's clear the bodies  have been lying in the open for weeks  and critically during the time russian  forces occupied the town  we've compared the satellite imagery and  ukrainian soldiers video  by highlighting bodies seen on the  street it's clear they're in the same  locations in both the video and the  satellite imagery  the images show bodies on yablonska  street a suburban road in the south of  butcher  in several shots from the video shapes  that appear in the satellite imagery  correspond to where bodies were found  after the russians retreated  these high-resolution images discredit  claims the bodies were planted after the  russian withdrawal and contribute to  mounting evidence that the kremlin has  potentially committed war crimes in the  conflict

